{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And in Kings</b> [19:25] <b>to prostrate</b>: fortified cities shall prostrate themselves with manifest waves. <b>And in Isaiah</b> [37:26] <b>to raise</b>, with alef, from the root שוא (Isaiah 10:3), like גלים נצים (manifest waves); or the vav interchanges with alef as is their rule."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:49.131113469Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}